    html: '<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>极光光谱演播室</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"><script src="app.js" defer></script></head><body><main><header><div><small>PERCEPTION ATELIER / 视觉实验档案</small><h1>极光光谱演播室</h1><p>把磁场条带、暮色地平线和星图编成一段可调光谱。按下快门冻结当前画面，再改变光束密度与色调。</p></div><span class="badge">INTERACTIVE EDITION / 02</span></header><section class="stage"><canvas id="view" aria-label="极光 Canvas 后备"></canvas><canvas id="gpu" aria-label="极光光谱渲染"></canvas><div class="hud"><span class="eyebrow">AURORA / SPECTRAL STUDY</span><strong>Light written\nin the night.</strong><p id="spectrum">SPECTRUM 01 · JADE / ULTRAVIOLET</p></div><span class="stamp" id="frame">EXPOSURE / 004.2 S</span><div class="corner">POLAR LATITUDE 68° N<br>PROCEDURAL LIGHT FIELD</div></section><section class="panel"><div class="controls"><label>光谱方案<select id="palette"><option value="0">翡翠 / 紫外</option><option value="1">珊瑚 / 冰蓝</option><option value="2">金色 / 深蓝</option></select></label><label>条带密度<input id="density" type="range" min="3" max="12" value="7"></label><label>曝光增益<input id="gain" type="range" min="30" max="130" value="78"></label></div><div class="actions"><button id="play" aria-pressed="false">启动演播</button><button id="shutter">冻结快门</button><button id="reset">磁场归零</button></div><output class="status" id="status" aria-live="polite"></output></section><div class="legend"><span><i class="key"></i>浏览器内原创图形 · 演示状态</span><span>触控 / 键盘控件可用 · 不加载外部素材</span></div><footer>可运行的视觉交互学习作品 · 完整来源、迁移范围与许可在 NOTICE.txt</footer></main></body></html>',
