    html: '<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>等高线地形档案</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"><script src="app.js" defer></script></head><body><main><header><div><small>PERCEPTION ATELIER / 视觉实验档案</small><h1>等高线地形档案</h1><p>在一张虚构岛屿档案里探索海岸与山脊。改变海平面，生成新的地形种子，再点击地图记录高程探针。</p></div><span class="badge">INTERACTIVE EDITION / 02</span></header><section class="stage"><canvas id="view" aria-label="可点击的程序化地形地图"></canvas><div class="hud"><span class="eyebrow">TOPOGRAPHIC ARCHIVE</span><strong>Uncharted\nterrain.</strong><p id="sheet">SHEET 018 / SYNTHETIC ISLAND</p></div><span class="stamp" id="probe">点击地图设置测量点</span><div class="corner">1 : 25,000 / DEMO<br>CONTOUR SURVEY GRID</div></section><section class="panel"><div class="controls"><label>海平面<input id="sea" type="range" min="15" max="70" value="38"></label><label>等高线间距<input id="interval" type="range" min="4" max="18" value="9"></label><label>地形视图<select id="mapmode"><option value="0">矿物色谱</option><option value="1">测绘蓝图</option></select></label></div><div class="actions"><button id="seed">生成新档案</button><button id="transect" aria-pressed="false">显示剖面线</button><button id="center">探针归中</button></div><output class="status" id="status" aria-live="polite"></output></section><div class="legend"><span><i class="key"></i>浏览器内原创图形 · 演示状态</span><span>触控 / 键盘控件可用 · 不加载外部素材</span></div><footer>可运行的视觉交互学习作品 · 完整来源、迁移范围与许可在 NOTICE.txt</footer></main></body></html>',
